The device trees in this directory (jh7110-starfive-visionfive-2-v1.2a.dtb,
jh7110-starfive-visionfive-2-v1.3b.dtb, and their copies below starfive/)
are compiled from the Linux kernel v6.12
(commit adc218676eef25575469234709c2d87185ca223a),
arch/riscv/boot/dts/starfive/ and include/dt-bindings/, which are licensed
GPL-2.0 OR MIT (the GPIO and power-domain headers, GPL-2.0 OR
BSD-2-Clause, supply only numbers; the thermal header is replaced by a
zedBSD one).  zedBSD distributes them under the MIT license:

